<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">struct<sp/>printf_functor</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>__host__<sp/>__device__</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>void<sp/>operator()(int<sp/>x)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>note<sp/>that<sp/>using<sp/>printf<sp/>in<sp/>a<sp/>__device__<sp/>function<sp/>requires</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>code<sp/>compiled<sp/>for<sp/>a<sp/>GPU<sp/>with<sp/>compute<sp/>capability<sp/>2.0<sp/>or</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>//<sp/>higher<sp/>(nvcc<sp/>--arch=sm_20)</highlight></codeline>
